{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "8fa119520bead0a04551b934ce49e819315713d535ef79cfde0f03c9a2e0b1ce", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-8fa119520bead0a04551", "filename": "11-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "8fa119520bead0a04551b934ce49e819315713d535ef79cfde0f03c9a2e0b1ce", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/8fa119520bead0a04551b934ce49e819315713d535ef79cfde0f03c9a2e0b1ce.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/8fa119520bead0a04551b934ce49e819315713d535ef79cfde0f03c9a2e0b1ce.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1B-SulB-Ewr3tXqEB4rqI-e43bnTeJtga-C-1", "label": "Jahshan set 11 · Part C · Extract 1", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [133, 134], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "How does Dr Lee describe the movement from traditional care systems to non-visit care?\nA Large pre-existing medical providers will probably dominate the market.\nB There will be a mixture of reactions from existing and new organisations.\nC Flexible new organisations will have an advantage over existing ones.", "sourcePage": 133, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "According to Dr Lee a non-visit care culture\nA views face to face consultations as a final resort in treatment.\nB will develop more rapidly in new medical start-ups.\nC\nrequires a blend of responses from medical organisations.", "sourcePage": 133, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Dr Lee believes that current technology is\nA closely matched to users medical needs.\nB changing expectations for medical services.\nC not capable of supporting non-visit care yet.", "sourcePage": 133, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Dr Lee suggests that in person visits\nA ideally occur earlier in the care process.\nB have a negative impact on many patients.\nC should be easy for patients to manage.", "sourcePage": 134, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Why does Dr Lee mention specimen collection services?\nA To highlight the expense of creating offices and labs.\nB To describe how these services could be provided more efficiently.\nC\nTo suggest they could be delivered more nimbly with technology.", "sourcePage": 134, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "What advice does Dr Lee give organisations wanting to move to non-visit care models?\nA Wait for more precise technology before transitioning to remote care.\nB Re-evaluate the safety and quality of non-visit care before making the change.\nC Find transition opportunities by close analysis of each instance of in-person care.\n\nE2 Language Listening Part C.2\nExtract 2", "sourcePage": 134, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["8fa119520bead0a04551b934ce49e819315713d535ef79cfde0f03c9a2e0b1ce"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}, {"id": "jahshan-1B-SulB-Ewr3tXqEB4rqI-e43bnTeJtga-C-2", "label": "Jahshan set 11 · Part C · Extract 2", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [135, 136], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "The research suggests that in the USA\nA supervised injection centres are fundamentally different.\nB supervised injection centres are being successfully integrated.\nC supervised injection centres have the same impact as elsewhere.", "sourcePage": 135, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "According to Dr Davidson the secret facility was\nA based on international evidence and good practice.\nB waiting for legal advocacy in the United States.\nC experiencing the death of too many patients.", "sourcePage": 135, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "According to Dr Davidson what is the outcome of having staff and drug users in the same\nroom?\nA Patient check in and registration is more efficient.\nB Overdose prevention is the major benefit.\nC\nStaff can address many potential health issues.", "sourcePage": 135, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "What does Davidson suggest users of the centre most appreciate?\nA the clean and hygienic surfaces\nB the private and relaxed space\nC they can't get arrested there", "sourcePage": 136, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Some users of the facility suggested that the facility\nA needs a far more open space.\nB can't combine with other services since it is secret.\nC would be better as a treatment agency.", "sourcePage": 136, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "What concern did staff raise about the running of the facility?\nA That patients might disclose information about the centre\nB Necessary exclusion of psychologically ill patients\nC\nThe small number of patients they could help", "sourcePage": 136, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 138, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["8fa119520bead0a04551b934ce49e819315713d535ef79cfde0f03c9a2e0b1ce"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
